WEBVTT

00:01.770 --> 00:05.320
While Fleur-de-lis' plan to create his ideal world is progressing,

00:01.980 --> 00:11.820
While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.

00:05.760 --> 00:07.990
everyone else was occupied with their own missions:

00:08.560 --> 00:11.860
Citron with the recapture of the Prism Tower,

00:12.200 --> 00:16.580
Serena with helping Manon rescue Hari-san, and Eureka with the pursuit of Squishy.

00:17.750 --> 00:25.900
In addition, Satoshi and Gekkouga broke through Fleur-de-lis' controlling light and are now starting their counterattack with Alan.

00:31.270 --> 00:32.620
Onvern, Boomburst!

00:32.890 --> 00:34.810
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

00:39.940 --> 00:42.070
You can use as many Pokémon as you want, you still stand no chance!

00:42.590 --> 00:43.640
Hyper Beam!

00:45.260 --> 00:46.590
Dragon Tail!

00:55.150 --> 00:55.980
Onvern!

01:03.010 --> 01:04.500
Thank you, Onvern.

01:07.060 --> 01:07.870
Dragon Claw!

01:11.200 --> 01:12.580
Luchabull, High Jump Kick!

01:17.410 --> 01:17.970
Catch it!

01:23.320 --> 01:23.900
Luchabull!

01:27.600 --> 01:28.700
You did well, Luchabull!

01:29.220 --> 01:30.040
Leave the rest to us.

01:31.670 --> 01:32.210
This...

01:32.760 --> 01:34.780
<i>This</i> is the power of Mega Evolution!

01:36.820 --> 01:40.140
This power, which only blooms in battle, is what you might call a fighting instinct.

01:40.980 --> 01:45.660
Something that Pokémon have usually forgotten due to being domesticated by humans.

01:46.620 --> 01:48.910
Once that fighting instinct is released,

01:49.680 --> 01:52.110
the Pokémon will obtain a new power!

01:52.780 --> 01:53.310
You're wrong.

01:53.760 --> 01:54.510
Mega Evolution is...

01:55.090 --> 01:58.260
Only the winner can prove what it is, Alan.

01:59.020 --> 02:00.350
Hyper Beam!

02:06.520 --> 02:07.270
Wait!

02:07.270 --> 02:09.880
Let me go! Let me go to Squishy!

02:09.880 --> 02:10.980
What can a little girl like you do?

02:11.540 --> 02:12.750
I will save Squishy!

02:13.160 --> 02:15.600
I promised it I'd never let it go!

02:18.450 --> 02:19.300
Let go!

02:19.840 --> 02:20.240
Eureka!

02:31.070 --> 02:36.760
Attack on Miare Gym!
The Citroid Forever!!

02:37.780 --> 02:47.650
Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY& data broadcast!
Press the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!

02:37.780 --> 02:47.650
Z

02:41.740 --> 02:43.070
I have successfully unlocked it.

02:47.530 --> 02:48.330
Who are you?!

02:48.870 --> 02:50.750
I am Citron, the Gym Leader of the Miare Gym!

02:51.070 --> 02:53.480
Likewise, I am the deputy Gym Leader, Citroid!

02:54.100 --> 02:54.570
Citroid...

02:55.180 --> 02:56.000
I know.

02:58.570 --> 02:59.500
There are three enemies,

02:59.750 --> 03:00.740
one in the back.

03:01.410 --> 03:05.520
I have detected the same components from that machine as those the red Zygarde has.

03:06.300 --> 03:07.700
The control system, huh?

03:08.520 --> 03:12.180
I might be able to get into and stop the main system.

03:12.510 --> 03:12.710
All right.

03:13.430 --> 03:14.090
Electric Terrain!

03:21.390 --> 03:22.750
Citroid, now is your chance!

03:23.090 --> 03:23.300
Yes!

03:23.950 --> 03:25.640
You're noisy.

03:27.020 --> 03:27.350
Hm?

03:28.490 --> 03:29.330
Oh my.

03:29.770 --> 03:32.180
Seems like an annoying little insect has broken in.

03:33.470 --> 03:35.210
What on earth are Bara and Akebi doing?

03:36.030 --> 03:38.540
You are using that system to control Zygarde, right?

03:39.290 --> 03:42.240
That's right. This is the fruit of my inventive skills!

03:42.760 --> 03:45.230
It manipulates Pokémon and brings disorder to the city!

03:45.650 --> 03:48.370
Anything that makes everyone unhappy cannot be called an invention!

03:49.860 --> 03:51.330
What do you know?

03:52.240 --> 03:55.240
Inventions are meant to <i>help</i> people and Pokémon.

03:56.680 --> 03:58.670
You think <i>that</i> will change the world?

04:01.780 --> 04:03.090
I believe it will, yes.

04:04.120 --> 04:05.770
Crobat, Air Slash!

04:05.770 --> 04:07.390
Calamanero, Psycho Cut!

04:10.500 --> 04:11.680
Horubee, Mud Shot!

04:11.990 --> 04:13.060
Harimaron, Pin Missile!

04:22.620 --> 04:22.880
Hm?

04:24.290 --> 04:25.970
We have guests, Manyula.

04:27.490 --> 04:28.670
Somebody's down there.

04:29.450 --> 04:30.350
Ice Shard!

04:36.750 --> 04:37.970
Tairenar, let's go!

04:38.930 --> 04:40.570
Manyula, Ice Shard!

04:41.650 --> 04:42.590
Flamethrower!

04:47.220 --> 04:48.260
Serena is amazing!

04:49.090 --> 04:49.980
Icy Wind!

04:55.720 --> 04:56.250
Hold on!

04:58.310 --> 04:59.060
Geez, what's this?!

05:00.340 --> 05:00.770
That's...

05:04.340 --> 05:05.260
...Daigo-san!

05:05.260 --> 05:05.540
Huh?

05:05.910 --> 05:07.280
Huh? The Champion?!

05:11.220 --> 05:12.310
Meteor Mash.

05:19.950 --> 05:21.770
Daigo, the Champion of Houen.

05:22.380 --> 05:24.140
Fleur-de-lis-san sure had me fooled.

05:24.990 --> 05:26.750
To think he had deceived the entire world...

05:27.070 --> 05:29.840
Oh, he didn't deceive anyone at all.

05:30.150 --> 05:32.390
This is a great undertaking to remake the world.

05:34.350 --> 05:35.140
A great undertaking, huh?

05:35.980 --> 05:38.020
You have better support us, for your own good.

05:41.040 --> 05:41.980
You wanna fight?

05:42.580 --> 05:46.300
I'll teach you who's the strongest and most amazing one here.

05:47.060 --> 05:47.900
Daigo-san!

05:48.610 --> 05:49.660
Thank you for coming.

05:50.600 --> 05:53.440
Good thing I came to check on this place before heading to Miare.

05:53.820 --> 05:55.620
Manon-kun's Harimaron is in there.

05:56.120 --> 05:57.130
And the megalith, too.

05:57.890 --> 05:58.180
Yeah.

05:59.060 --> 06:01.070
It really <i>is</i> the Houen Champion.

06:01.070 --> 06:02.060
I'll get myself...

06:02.260 --> 06:02.870
...a nice man!

06:03.160 --> 06:03.910
Stop it.

06:06.110 --> 06:06.900
I'll handle this.

06:07.330 --> 06:07.950
You guys go inside!

06:08.270 --> 06:08.640
Okay!

06:13.230 --> 06:14.730
Manyula, Ice Shard!

06:16.580 --> 06:17.490
Dark Pulse!

06:18.730 --> 06:19.600
Flash Cannon!

06:24.190 --> 06:24.760
This way!

06:25.000 --> 06:28.810
We have just broken into the den of evil, the Flare Gang's base.

06:29.130 --> 06:31.470
We will take the risk of providing an on-the-spot report on this suicide mission!

06:40.070 --> 06:40.950
Are you all right?

06:42.070 --> 06:43.000
Oh my!

06:44.210 --> 06:46.550
You need to arrange permission for filming here.

06:46.980 --> 06:47.930
Now...

06:47.930 --> 06:49.330
...you've really done it!

06:49.490 --> 06:51.510
You've made us angry!

06:51.960 --> 06:52.560
Ha!

06:55.010 --> 06:55.940
The Rocket Gang?

06:56.430 --> 06:58.100
You guys again?

06:59.390 --> 07:00.090
Just go already.

07:00.450 --> 07:02.020
You're gonna save your precious Pokémon, right?

07:03.050 --> 07:03.520
Yeah.

07:04.370 --> 07:06.940
This is that "The enemy of our enemy is our friend" thing.

07:07.730 --> 07:10.590
We don't intend on handing the world over without a fight.

07:11.370 --> 07:12.640
The world belongs to the Rocket Gang!

07:12.900 --> 07:13.140
No...

07:13.440 --> 07:15.110
To Sakaki-sama!

07:15.420 --> 07:17.740
Oh my, will you stop getting in the way?

07:17.740 --> 07:19.510
Oh my, I think <i>you're</i> the ones that are in the way!

07:19.770 --> 07:20.250
Pumpjin!

07:20.710 --> 07:21.990
Maaiika, Psybeam!

07:26.510 --> 07:27.070
Dorapion,

07:27.630 --> 07:28.410
Sludge Bomb!

07:30.740 --> 07:31.620
Now, hurry!

07:35.040 --> 07:36.040
Thunder Punch!

07:39.710 --> 07:40.820
Dragon Pulse!

07:45.190 --> 07:46.360
Hyper Beam!

07:54.990 --> 07:56.260
Return, Numelgon!

07:58.890 --> 07:59.910
Are you done already?

08:00.340 --> 08:01.170
Not yet.

08:01.850 --> 08:02.370
I...

08:02.830 --> 08:04.670
...won't give up till the end, no matter what!

08:05.620 --> 08:07.630
Fighting instinct, whatever...

08:08.090 --> 08:09.950
There's more to a Pokémon's power than that.

08:10.610 --> 08:12.020
I've realized during my journey...

08:12.520 --> 08:15.090
...that me and my Pokémon's strength is constantly believing in each other...

08:15.530 --> 08:18.590
...and constantly loving each other no matter what.

08:23.540 --> 08:25.960
If you don't get it, I will show you here and now!

08:27.410 --> 08:27.980
Fiarrow!

08:28.230 --> 08:29.130
Flame Charge!

08:29.630 --> 08:30.300
Gekkouga!

08:30.520 --> 08:31.500
Use Cut!

08:33.390 --> 08:34.770
Stone Edge!

08:37.580 --> 08:38.570
Catch them!

08:41.920 --> 08:42.460
Above you!

08:42.760 --> 08:43.710
Dragon Tail!

08:52.810 --> 08:54.490
Fiarrow, thank you.

09:00.060 --> 09:00.850
What's the matter?

09:01.820 --> 09:04.670
You've said some pretty arrogant things, yet this is all you've got to offer?

09:05.070 --> 09:06.300
All right, this is the end.

09:06.700 --> 09:07.880
Hyper Beam!

09:15.590 --> 09:16.190
You're...

09:17.360 --> 09:17.910
Pachira!

09:19.290 --> 09:21.200
Let's stop this already, Fleur-de-lis.

09:21.760 --> 09:22.390
Pachira...

09:22.790 --> 09:23.750
What are you trying to do?

09:24.640 --> 09:25.400
I've decided...

09:26.130 --> 09:28.210
...to place my bets on these children.

09:31.480 --> 09:32.430
Pokémon Quiz.

09:32.990 --> 09:33.830
The answer is...

09:35.800 --> 09:45.740
Coming up next:

09:35.800 --> 09:40.770
Citron VS Xerosicy

09:36.690 --> 09:41.420
Pocket Monsters XY&Z is brought to you by these sponsors.

09:40.800 --> 09:45.740
And then the Citroid...!!

09:52.730 --> 09:56.750
I agree that the world definitely can't be called happy the way it is now.

09:57.710 --> 09:59.590
Then why are you getting in my way?

10:00.570 --> 10:01.830
Because I watched them.

10:02.640 --> 10:05.620
Changing the world cannot mean destroying it.

10:06.210 --> 10:07.790
There are other people like these guys in this world.

10:08.460 --> 10:09.800
Then let me ask you, Pachira:

10:10.420 --> 10:12.760
Just what kind of world do you think these people will be able to create,

10:13.510 --> 10:15.840
considering they're about to lose?

10:16.560 --> 10:17.840
They haven't lost yet.

10:19.850 --> 10:22.230
Of course, these guys alone can't do anything.

10:22.990 --> 10:27.010
But if we adults lend them a helping hand when they need one, we can make a change for sure.

10:27.950 --> 10:30.150
I want to see the future of these boys.

10:32.330 --> 10:34.150
This isn't going anywhere.

10:35.020 --> 10:37.180
You can join them and get out of here!

10:37.610 --> 10:38.220
Gyarados,

10:38.430 --> 10:39.710
incinerate them!

10:42.450 --> 10:44.250
Gekkouga, Water Shuriken!

10:51.980 --> 10:52.610
Fleur-de-lis!

10:53.230 --> 10:55.700
I don't care if you hate this world or not;

10:56.190 --> 10:57.580
the world belongs to humans and Pokémon alike.

10:58.070 --> 10:59.290
It belongs to everyone!

11:00.180 --> 11:01.390
Stop being selfish and talking about...

11:02.020 --> 11:04.550
...how you're going to destroy or change it, or that we won't live to see tomorrow!

11:06.440 --> 11:08.350
Those who will meet someone dear to them tomorrow,

11:09.480 --> 11:11.140
those who will achieve their dreams tomorrow,

11:12.270 --> 11:14.340
those who will start their journeys as Trainers tomorrow,

11:15.650 --> 11:17.110
and those whose wounds will heal tomorrow;

11:18.450 --> 11:20.300
each and every one of them has their own tomorrow!

11:21.470 --> 11:24.180
You have no good reason to not let them see that tomorrow!

11:25.210 --> 11:26.030
That's why...

11:26.610 --> 11:28.920
...me and my Pokémon will fight for their tomorrow!

11:32.620 --> 11:34.840
Why don't you believe them and entrust the future to them?

11:38.240 --> 11:40.340
Honestly, that's so naïve.

11:41.300 --> 11:44.510
Even I thought the same thing long ago!

11:47.030 --> 11:48.930
Thank goodness it's safe.

11:49.600 --> 11:51.270
Let's take it to my lab.

11:51.800 --> 11:52.730
Please.

12:00.400 --> 12:01.420
Geez, you're pesky!

12:03.120 --> 12:03.930
How's Hari-san?

12:03.930 --> 12:04.600
It's fine.

12:05.530 --> 12:05.900
Look.

12:06.400 --> 12:07.080
Thank goodness.

12:08.200 --> 12:10.550
Now we just need to think of a way to get out of this.

12:15.290 --> 12:16.160
You guys...

12:17.680 --> 12:19.380
...don't want to get hurt, right?

12:19.950 --> 12:20.880
Daigo-san!

12:27.530 --> 12:28.600
Thank you, Burshamo.

12:31.460 --> 12:32.100
Squishy...

12:32.920 --> 12:33.860
Will you really be all right?

12:34.710 --> 12:36.180
Squishy will recognize me.

12:36.830 --> 12:37.860
Believe in me!

12:38.720 --> 12:39.330
Squishy,

12:39.710 --> 12:40.610
you'll be okay now.

12:41.200 --> 12:42.630
It's me! Eureka!

12:43.020 --> 12:43.610
You recognize me, right?

12:44.430 --> 12:44.990
Squishy...

12:45.440 --> 12:47.160
You don't really want to do these things, right?

12:48.180 --> 12:49.390
Eureka knows!

12:54.490 --> 12:55.390
Burshamo Mask!

12:58.310 --> 12:59.030
Squishy!

13:07.370 --> 13:08.350
You're squishy,

13:10.230 --> 13:11.060
squishy,

13:12.430 --> 13:14.920
and so soft

13:16.200 --> 13:16.990
You're squishy,

13:18.380 --> 13:19.100
squishy,

13:20.650 --> 13:22.960
and so green

13:24.280 --> 13:25.170
You're squishy,

13:25.950 --> 13:26.820
squishy,

13:27.890 --> 13:30.140
and the inside of my pochette

13:31.210 --> 13:36.500
Is your favorite place, Squishy!

13:45.410 --> 13:46.080
You're squishy,

13:46.970 --> 13:47.710
squishy,

13:48.470 --> 13:50.430
and so soft

13:51.460 --> 13:52.090
You're squishy,

13:52.790 --> 13:53.580
squishy,

13:54.380 --> 13:56.350
and so green

13:57.460 --> 13:58.140
You're squishy,

13:58.960 --> 13:59.680
squishy,

14:00.610 --> 14:02.570
and the inside of my pochette

14:03.530 --> 14:08.120
Is your favorite place, Squishy!

14:09.200 --> 14:13.350
Where did you come from?

14:14.460 --> 14:18.610
Why is Mister Sun your food?

14:19.490 --> 14:23.710
I love my mysterious Squishy so much!

14:24.180 --> 14:28.690
Teach me more about you!

14:29.510 --> 14:34.050
When you and I

14:34.760 --> 14:38.920
Have nuzzled,

14:39.560 --> 14:44.270
We're already friends

14:44.950 --> 14:49.130
We'll always be together!

14:49.910 --> 14:52.570
I'll...

14:53.430 --> 14:57.380
...protect you!

15:19.470 --> 15:20.070
Squishy...

15:21.180 --> 15:22.360
You heard it, right?

15:25.090 --> 15:26.320
My voice, I mean.

15:33.950 --> 15:34.750
Squishy!

15:48.190 --> 15:48.930
What's that?

15:49.330 --> 15:51.050
Zygarde is splitting...

15:51.950 --> 15:53.230
Xerosicy, what's going on?

15:53.850 --> 15:56.290
Fleur-de-lis-sama, this is not the time.

15:56.550 --> 15:58.090
Battling an intruder right now.

15:58.580 --> 15:59.520
An intruder, you say?

16:00.260 --> 16:02.310
It's the Gym Leader of the Miare Gym.

16:02.670 --> 16:03.230
Citron...

16:04.240 --> 16:05.690
Every one of you is...!

16:18.860 --> 16:19.490
Squishy...

16:20.510 --> 16:21.650
Everything will be fine now.

16:23.540 --> 16:24.980
Harimaron, Pin Missile!

16:25.250 --> 16:26.380
Horubee, Mud Shot!

16:34.970 --> 16:36.210
Return, guys!

16:38.290 --> 16:39.390
Huh? What?!

16:40.090 --> 16:42.390
Citron-sama, I have successfully broken into the system.

16:42.760 --> 16:44.140
What are you doing?!

16:44.140 --> 16:45.060
Citroid, activate you-know-what!

16:45.640 --> 16:46.160
Roger!

16:47.270 --> 16:47.810
Whoa!

16:48.030 --> 16:49.700
Wah!

16:51.880 --> 16:53.440
That worked out fine, did it not, Citron-sama?

16:54.560 --> 16:56.570
I never thought I would see the day when that would become useful.

16:57.250 --> 16:58.670
It is my invention!

17:00.910 --> 17:02.740
Initiating synchronization of the system and the Citroid.

17:03.370 --> 17:04.900
I will now shut down the entire system!

17:06.580 --> 17:07.330
What is this?

17:08.200 --> 17:11.350
If we forcefully shut it down in this manner,

17:12.050 --> 17:13.940
it will greatly strain the system,

17:14.590 --> 17:18.260
and as I am synchronized with it, my main memory will be wiped as well.

17:19.100 --> 17:19.880
All of it?

17:20.290 --> 17:20.520
Yes.

17:21.390 --> 17:21.930
Wait, wait.

17:22.450 --> 17:23.950
I cannot do that.

17:24.320 --> 17:27.110
But if you do not do it, this fight will not end.

17:29.200 --> 17:29.920
Citron-sama...

17:30.740 --> 17:32.500
The Citron-sama I know is...

17:33.230 --> 17:35.360
...the proud Gym Leader of the Miare Gym.

17:36.430 --> 17:37.620
You are someone who is kind...

17:38.300 --> 17:40.760
...and who can devote himself to the needs of others.

17:42.730 --> 17:43.660
You can do it.

17:44.590 --> 17:45.230
You really can!

17:54.480 --> 17:55.100
I know.

17:55.860 --> 17:56.500
I know.

17:58.090 --> 17:58.510
I have to do this.

17:59.810 --> 18:00.350
If I do not do it,

18:00.670 --> 18:01.760
I cannot save anything.

18:17.470 --> 18:20.130
You are someone who can save the world.

18:21.110 --> 18:22.680
You told me...

18:22.980 --> 18:24.760
...that we should grow together.

18:25.550 --> 18:28.000
Let us grow together, Citroid.

18:29.130 --> 18:30.350
Understood.

18:32.010 --> 18:32.910
I was happy.

18:34.030 --> 18:34.800
Thank you.

18:36.280 --> 18:37.060
Citroid...

18:38.860 --> 18:40.340
I am glad to have met you.

18:41.200 --> 18:41.490
Yes.

18:42.120 --> 18:45.540
I was happy that you created me as well.

18:46.830 --> 18:47.710
Citroid...

19:28.910 --> 19:29.730
What's the matter?

19:48.980 --> 19:51.110
The other one has been released as well.

19:52.040 --> 19:53.230
Did Citron do this?

19:54.030 --> 19:54.810
I'm sure it was him!

19:55.680 --> 19:57.970
Fleur-de-lis, you've already lost.

20:00.750 --> 20:04.590
Just how much are you going to entertain me?

20:10.360 --> 20:14.890
Citron and Eureka have finally managed to release the Zygarde from being controlled.

20:15.830 --> 20:19.590
Will Satoshi and Alan be able to protect tomorrow from Fleur-de-lis?

20:20.480 --> 20:24.460
The Flare Gang incident that shakes Kalos takes another sudden turn.

20:35.160 --> 20:35.750
Ladies and gentlemen,

20:36.120 --> 20:38.100
this time I will talk about the legendary megalith,

20:38.750 --> 20:40.960
which is in our possession.

20:42.420 --> 20:45.390
While we were researching Mega Evolution energy,

20:45.790 --> 20:49.070
we came to know of the existence of a legendary megalith spoken of in the Houen region.

20:49.530 --> 20:53.050
This legendary megalith is believed to be the roots of Mega Evolution...

20:53.370 --> 20:56.650
...and has enough energy to destroy the world.

20:57.050 --> 21:03.720
The legendary Pokémon Primal Kyogre, Primal Groudon and Mega Rayquaza fought over this power!

21:04.040 --> 21:08.910
We have succeeded in obtaining this great energy!

21:09.300 --> 21:13.090
Fleur-de-lis-sama is planning to use this megalith for something!

21:13.510 --> 21:17.330
Let's look forward to seeing what he's planning!

21:18.080 --> 21:20.440
Those who sympathize with the Flare Gang's ideals,

21:20.910 --> 21:24.080
we're waiting for you to join!

21:24.740 --> 21:27.130
Chuei performs a Gekkouga skit?

21:24.800 --> 21:29.810
Sunday September 11th at 8am!

21:25.380 --> 21:29.810
Nagareboshi

21:27.130 --> 21:28.200
On Sunday at 8am!

21:28.310 --> 21:28.840
Gekkouga!

